# Portfolio (always)

Personal site for Vamsi Batchu. Prefer craft + interaction over generic case-study chrome.

## Stack

React 19 + TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind v4, React Router, framer-motion. Some Three.js / Matter.js for experiments.

## Routes

| Path | Page |
| --- | --- |
| `/` | Landing gate (outside shell) |
| `/home` | Home |
| `/work` | Work |
| `/experiments` | Experiments (BrowserField) |
| `/writing` | Writing archive + editor |
| `/about` | About |

Pages under shell: `src/pages/*` via `Layout`. Routes: `src/App.tsx`.

## Design defaults

- Site chrome / body: **JetBrains Mono**, lowercase UI labels
- White shell; pastel `Mark` accents in nav
- Prefer existing patterns over new design systems
- Avoid generic AI looks (purple gradients, cream+serif+terracotta, dense broadsheet)

## Content lives in data + assets

Do **not** hardcode new blogs/experiments into JSX. Extend:

- Writing list → `src/data/writing.ts`
- Writing bodies → `src/data/writing-articles/index.json`
- Experiments → `src/data/experiments.json` + video files
- Home posters → `src/assets/home-assets/` + `Home.tsx` imports

See `AGENTS.md` and colocated READMEs for add checklists. Vision/changelog: `overview.md`.

## When shipping a content workflow change

Update the matching rule/runbook in the same PR/session so day-30 agents stay accurate.
